{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Hey John! Guess what? Me and my family are currently on the road trip! We`ve already visited my friends Josh and Mark and had such a great time!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-4121b5ccc19b3eb0a8e9f677", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.041304+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4121b5ccc19b3eb0a8e9f677", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4121b5ccc19b3eb0a8e9f677", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Hey James! That sounds awesome! I had a super fun weekend - I worked with a game developer on a project and it was great to see my ideas come to life. It was an incredible experience!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-13f13b73364118de3c6f8d02", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.070723+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "13f13b73364118de3c6f8d02", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "13f13b73364118de3c6f8d02", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: That sounds amazing. What was the project you worked on?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-b86f64af478c44b5609c8e86", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.088319+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b86f64af478c44b5609c8e86", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b86f64af478c44b5609c8e86", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: I collaborated with a game developer to create an online board game - it's a fun and unique experience!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-4399914333f8685913492953", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.101921+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4399914333f8685913492953", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4399914333f8685913492953", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: I can imagine how proud you must feel seeing your ideas come to life in a game. Has it been released for others to try yet?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-e67a4ff70b0e52522ed06925", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.117017+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e67a4ff70b0e52522ed06925", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e67a4ff70b0e52522ed06925", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: We're about to release a demo soon so others can try it out. Can't wait for their feedback and suggestions."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-25450468dc27670a615a9ee1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.133529+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "25450468dc27670a615a9ee1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "25450468dc27670a615a9ee1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Can't wait to try it. Keep me posted when it's out - I wanna support you and give my thoughts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-9830743f07a3e9d2ece538e7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.148884+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9830743f07a3e9d2ece538e7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9830743f07a3e9d2ece538e7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Appreciate your support. I'll definitely let you know when it's out and I'm really excited to hear your thoughts."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-9ff4cfb5c6c68c6db8f7f27d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.161888+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9ff4cfb5c6c68c6db8f7f27d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9ff4cfb5c6c68c6db8f7f27d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: By the way, we did one good thing on the way to Mark and Josh."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-a8673c1d345a42653a986362", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.176997+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a8673c1d345a42653a986362", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a8673c1d345a42653a986362", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: What is this? Looking forward to hearing your story!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-a5e547477b78e362e1248cd9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.190501+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a5e547477b78e362e1248cd9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a5e547477b78e362e1248cd9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: We visited an animal sanctuary on the road trip - there were so many cute rescue dogs! I thought of our love of furry pals."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-5bfe10dd089c3748b38ccc83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.205300+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5bfe10dd089c3748b38ccc83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5bfe10dd089c3748b38ccc83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Cool! What was it like visiting the animal sanctuary? Did you feel tempted to bring any furry pals home?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-87f713931927ce97ac7b1c0f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.222551+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "87f713931927ce97ac7b1c0f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "87f713931927ce97ac7b1c0f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Those rescue dogs were so cute, I wanted to take them all home, but I remembered that I already have three dogs at home. I think having more than three dogs is too much."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-bd7f3341509fa3b448bb0560", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.233568+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bd7f3341509fa3b448bb0560", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bd7f3341509fa3b448bb0560", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: You are right! I still haven\u2019t gotten a dog, but I still really want one. What is it like to have a dog?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-d60d1a5b23eab7751ab90a80", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.248184+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d60d1a5b23eab7751ab90a80", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d60d1a5b23eab7751ab90a80", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Having furry friends around brings so much joy and friendship. Life wouldn't be the same without them. Every day's better with them around."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-d784ece3175f2badc9fae9e4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.263346+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d784ece3175f2badc9fae9e4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d784ece3175f2badc9fae9e4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yep, they bring so much joy and love. They're always there for us! It's like having sunshine on a cloudy day."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-b888d58943bfe4f978a334d3", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.278431+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b888d58943bfe4f978a334d3", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b888d58943bfe4f978a334d3", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: My dogs are like that too - they even make dark days better. Don't know what I'd do without them. They're the best buddies."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-739de1a9eac583234820375e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.294560+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "739de1a9eac583234820375e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "739de1a9eac583234820375e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Yeah, dogs are awesome for sure! They make us feel so loved and cheerful, don't they?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-ccff453d186c8dd73e1eae25", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.310395+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ccff453d186c8dd73e1eae25", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ccff453d186c8dd73e1eae25", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Yeah, they definitely do. Dogs always cheer us up, wagging their tails and giving us unconditional love. It's like having a dose of positivity and happiness every day. They're amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-25abfaf8021443bcf458b5e1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.323993+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "25abfaf8021443bcf458b5e1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "25abfaf8021443bcf458b5e1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Definitely, James! Dogs are amazing. They bring so much joy and positivity. They accept us without judgement, just love and happiness. I appreciate the daily dose of positivity they bring to my life. Special buddies for sure. By the way, here is my cousin's dog."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-f9d6f1ab09724ee805b7fb1c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.336136+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f9d6f1ab09724ee805b7fb1c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f9d6f1ab09724ee805b7fb1c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: This pup is so adorable! What's their name?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-0418eddff86ed99357b66a99", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.355307+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0418eddff86ed99357b66a99", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0418eddff86ed99357b66a99", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Their name is Luna."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-bdfb5ca1f8f199ad204a2299", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.364306+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bdfb5ca1f8f199ad204a2299", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bdfb5ca1f8f199ad204a2299", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Luna's a great name!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-d70c9354782910af955d67a1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.377319+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d70c9354782910af955d67a1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d70c9354782910af955d67a1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "John: Thanks, gonna go, sorry. Cheers! Bye!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-5995f55ad86cc43ba2a95263", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.392068+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5995f55ad86cc43ba2a95263", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5995f55ad86cc43ba2a95263", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "James: Later! Take care!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-47/session_31-063a4a0348096059d8aeed07", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:53:45.406732+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "063a4a0348096059d8aeed07", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "063a4a0348096059d8aeed07", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
